---
import TextPage from '../components/TextPage.astro';

const title = 'For Developers | Playzoni';
const description =
  'Want your game on Playzoni? See how to send us your browser game by email. We review every game before it goes live on phone and desktop.';
---
<TextPage title={title} description={description} canonicalPath="/developers" h1="For game developers">
  <p>
    Do you make browser games? We would like to hear from you. This page explains how to send us a game for Playzoni.
  </p>

  <h2>How to submit a game</h2>
  <p>Send an email to <a href="mailto:hello@playzoni.com">hello@playzoni.com</a> with:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>a link where we can play the game in a browser,</li>
    <li>the name of the game and your name or studio name,</li>
    <li>two or three sentences about what the game is and how to play it.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What happens next</h2>
  <p>
    We review every game we receive. We play it on a phone and on a desktop computer, and we check that it loads quickly,
    that the controls work, and that it is a good fit for a free browser games site. If it is a fit, we publish it with
    your name shown as the developer.
  </p>
  <p>
    We cannot promise that every game will be published. If we have questions, we will reply to your email.
  </p>

  <p>
    <a class="button" href="mailto:hello@playzoni.com?subject=Game%20submission">Email your game</a>
  </p>
</TextPage>
